            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.0.55

- Run related tests in each changed file’s owning package, using its configuration and package-relative paths.
- Deliver check completion notices to the current workspace owner before repair handoff, including after ownership changes.
- Confirm repair pickup from the current owner’s acknowledgement.

Requires macOS 26 or later and Apple silicon. Versions through 1.0.52 require one manual installation to enable in-app updates.
]]></description>
